    "InterestingBehavior is the only Boolean state-predicate-style operator (TLCGet(\"level\") > 20 => ~neutral(Leader)).",
    "All SVG/visualization helpers (Repeat, SVGDefs, Legend, GraphNodePos, N, E, U, Frame, ToFile, Alias, Network, NodesOfNetwork, NodeDimension, ArrowPosOffset) are constant-level value/string/record producers and go in OperatorDefNames_ValueDef.",
